# Checkpoints, datasets, personal photos and Python environments never belong in Git.
**/checkpoints/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.onnx
**/*.safetensors
**/*.part
**/*.download.json
# Original upstream code/notebooks/assets are installed locally for this integration.
# Keep them out of redistribution until their source/dataset rights are resolved.
**/upstream/
